n substances than regular blood. You\u2019ll be tossing not only trash but also pieces of extraterrestrial beings that left their mark behind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/a3ad795039a903b2ab3ba1c34e98b66b.avif?t=1767892397\" width=800 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/62bba81480d32ce99b2f3fe6e00481dc.poster.avif?t=1767892397\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/62bba81480d32ce99b2f3fe6e00481dc.webm?t=1767892397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/62bba81480d32ce99b2f3fe6e00481dc.mp4?t=1767892397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No good cleaner works alone! Gather your crew and take off together to traverse the vast expanse of the universe. Complete missions, tackle challenges, and collect resources to upgrade your gear, acquiring more powerful tools to fight the chaos! Only a united team can conquer the galactic mess ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras/f56cec976c8c09c9b84cf855b1d5d289.avif?t=1767892397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644020/extras_big/f56cec976c8c09c9b84cf855b1d5d289.avif?t=1767892397 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://s